      }
    },
    "A red palette reduces glare. Lower the screen brightness too. The moon button at the top of each tab and the Control Center control switch it as well. Field mode, from a park's \"I'm here tonight\", turns it on and dims the screen while it is open, then puts both back.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A red palette reduces glare. Lower the screen brightness too. The moon button at the top of each tab and the Control Center control switch it as well. Field mode, from a park's \"I'm here tonight\", turns it on and dims the screen while it is open, then puts both back."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Una paleta roja reduce el deslumbramiento. Baja también el brillo de la pantalla. El botón de la luna arriba de cada pestaña y el control del Centro de control también la activan. El modo de campo, desde \"Estoy aquí esta noche\" de un parque, la activa y atenúa la pantalla mientras está abierto, y luego restaura ambos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A report describes where the app stopped, with the app and iOS versions. It contains no location, journal or account information.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A report describes where the app stopped, with the app and iOS versions. It contains no location, journal or account information."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un informe describe dónde se detuvo la app, con las versiones de la app y de iOS. No contiene información de ubicación, del diario ni de cuentas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
