    "Location is used only while you use Nyx, to compare park distances on this iPhone and to work out the sky From home tonight, which asks no service for anything. Photos are accessed only through the system photo picker. Reminders and alarms are local. In field mode, Nyx uses motion on this iPhone to point the sky where you hold it; nothing is recorded.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "device": {
              "ipad": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Location is used only while you use Nyx, to compare park distances on this iPad and to work out the sky From home tonight, which asks no service for anything. Photos are accessed only through the system photo picker. Reminders and alarms are local. In field mode, Nyx uses motion on this iPad to point the sky where you hold it; nothing is recorded."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Location is used only while you use Nyx, to compare park distances on this iPhone and to work out the sky From home tonight, which asks no service for anything. Photos are accessed only through the system photo picker. Reminders and alarms are local. In field mode, Nyx uses motion on this iPhone to point the sky where you hold it; nothing is recorded."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "variations": {
            "device": {
              "ipad": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "La ubicación solo se usa mientras usas Nyx, para comparar distancias a los parques en este iPad y para calcular el cielo de Desde casa esta noche, que no pide nada a ningún servicio. Las fotos solo se abren con el selector de fotos del sistema. Los recordatorios y las alarmas son locales. En modo de campo, Nyx usa el movimiento de este iPad para orientar el cielo hacia donde lo sostienes; no se registra nada."
                }
              },
              "other": {
