    "Nyx has no light map for homes. Streetlights hide faint stars; the Moon, the planets and the brightest stars still show.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nyx has no light map for homes. Streetlights hide faint stars; the Moon, the planets and the brightest stars still show."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nyx no tiene un mapa de luz para los hogares. El alumbrado oculta las estrellas tenues; la Luna, los planetas y las estrellas más brillantes se siguen viendo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nyx is a planning aid, not a guarantee. A score never confirms that a road or park is open. Park updates may be unavailable. Cached alerts and programs show their update time. Check with the park before traveling, especially when Nyx has not checked alerts.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nyx is a planning aid, not a guarantee. A score never confirms that a road or park is open. Park updates may be unavailable. Cached alerts and programs show their update time. Check with the park before traveling, especially when Nyx has not checked alerts."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nyx es una ayuda para planear, no una garantía. Un índice nunca confirma que un camino o un parque estén abiertos. Puede que no haya actualizaciones del parque. Las alertas y los programas guardados muestran su hora de actualización. Consulta con el parque antes de viajar, sobre todo si Nyx no ha revisado las alertas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nyx is built on public science. Each source is credited here in the words it asks for.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nyx is built on public science. Each source is credited here in the words it asks for."
