    "Reduce Highlighting Effects dims the glows, halos and the Milky Way and keeps the shooting star away. Prefer Cross-Fade Transitions replaces the zoom and the month slide in Plan. When iOS asks apps to use less, the sky holds still.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reduce Highlighting Effects dims the glows, halos and the Milky Way and keeps the shooting star away. Prefer Cross-Fade Transitions replaces the zoom and the month slide in Plan. When iOS asks apps to use less, the sky holds still."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reducir efectos de resaltado atenúa los brillos, los halos y la Vía Láctea, y quita la estrella fugaz. Preferir transiciones de fundido reemplaza el zoom y el deslizamiento del mes en Planear. Cuando iOS pide a las apps que consuman menos, el cielo se queda quieto."
          }
        }
      }
    },
