    "Requests go to air-quality-api.open-meteo.com, the same provider's air-quality service, for all 63 parks at once, using the same viewing-spot coordinates only. It returns the CAMS aerosol forecast that warns when smoke or haze will hide faint stars. The service receives network information such as your IP address.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Requests go to air-quality-api.open-meteo.com, the same provider's air-quality service, for all 63 parks at once, using the same viewing-spot coordinates only. It returns the CAMS aerosol forecast that warns when smoke or haze will hide faint stars. The service receives network information such as your IP address."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las solicitudes van a air-quality-api.open-meteo.com, el servicio de calidad del aire del mismo proveedor, para los 63 parques a la vez y solo con las mismas coordenadas de los puntos de observación. Devuelve el pronóstico de aerosoles de CAMS, que avisa cuando el humo o la bruma ocultarán las estrellas débiles. El servicio recibe información de red, como tu dirección IP."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Requests go to api.open-meteo.com for all 63 parks at once: clouds, three forecast models for comparison, cloud layers, temperature, dew point, wind and visibility. They use the coordinates of each park's main viewing spot only, so they never reveal your location or which parks are near you. The service receives network information such as your IP address.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Requests go to api.open-meteo.com for all 63 parks at once: clouds, three forecast models for comparison, cloud layers, temperature, dew point, wind and visibility. They use the coordinates of each park's main viewing spot only, so they never reveal your location or which parks are near you. The service receives network information such as your IP address."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las solicitudes van a api.open-meteo.com para los 63 parques a la vez: nubes, tres modelos de pronóstico para comparar, capas de nubes, temperatura, punto de rocío, viento y visibilidad. Solo usan las coordenadas del punto de observación principal de cada parque, así que nunca revelan tu ubicación ni qué parques tienes cerca. El servicio recibe información de red, como tu dirección IP."
          }
        }
      }
    },
