        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A esta latitud, el centro brillante se queda bajo en el horizonte. Lo más importante es una vista despejada hacia el sur."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The bundled NPS inventory contains 63 national parks. Bortle classes are conservative estimates, not instrument measurements. Dark Sky designations are International Dark Sky Park certifications as of July 2026, cross-checked against the NPS list; a park certified later is not yet marked. Viewing coordinates are approximate, not directions. Park data: National Park Service.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The bundled NPS inventory contains 63 national parks. Bortle classes are conservative estimates, not instrument measurements. Dark Sky designations are International Dark Sky Park certifications as of July 2026, cross-checked against the NPS list; a park certified later is not yet marked. Viewing coordinates are approximate, not directions. Park data: National Park Service."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El inventario del NPS incluido contiene 63 parques nacionales. Las clases Bortle son estimaciones conservadoras, no mediciones con instrumentos. Las designaciones Dark Sky son certificaciones International Dark Sky Park a julio de 2026, verificadas con la lista del NPS; un parque certificado después aún no está marcado. Las coordenadas de observación son aproximadas, no indicaciones de ruta. Datos de parques: National Park Service."
          }
        }
      }
    },
