    "The four parts add up to %lld; the score takes the lowest cap that applies.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The four parts add up to %lld; the score takes the lowest cap that applies."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las cuatro partes suman %lld; el índice toma el límite más bajo que aplique."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The hourly forecast averaged over true darkness, eased toward the park's usual clouds beyond about three days. Model agreement and cloud layers are context; smoke or haze can cap the score.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The hourly forecast averaged over true darkness, eased toward the park's usual clouds beyond about three days. Model agreement and cloud layers are context; smoke or haze can cap the score."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El pronóstico por hora, promediado durante la oscuridad total y ajustado hacia la nubosidad habitual del parque después de unos tres días. La coincidencia entre modelos y las capas de nubes son contexto; el humo o la bruma pueden limitar el índice."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The hourly forecast averaged over true darkness. Beyond about three days it is eased toward the park's usual clouds for the month; with no forecast, the usual clouds count alone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The hourly forecast averaged over true darkness. Beyond about three days it is eased toward the park's usual clouds for the month; with no forecast, the usual clouds count alone."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El pronóstico por hora, promediado durante la oscuridad total. Después de unos tres días se ajusta hacia la nubosidad habitual del parque en ese mes; sin pronóstico, solo cuenta la nubosidad habitual."
          }
        }
      }
    },
