            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El índice es una guía para planear, no una garantía de visibilidad ni de acceso seguro."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The score will change as a forecast arrives.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The score will change as a forecast arrives."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El índice cambiará cuando llegue un pronóstico."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The shape of the night": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The shape of the night"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La forma de la noche"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The sky": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The sky"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El cielo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The sky glows white or orange, bright enough to read by.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The sky glows white or orange, bright enough to read by."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El cielo brilla blanco o anaranjado, tanto que se puede leer con su luz."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The sky is still in twilight.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The sky is still in twilight."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El cielo sigue en el crepúsculo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The sky over %@, %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The sky over %@, %@"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El cielo sobre %@, %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The summer Milky Way shows fine structure, and clouds look like black holes in the stars.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The summer Milky Way shows fine structure, and clouds look like black holes in the stars."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La Vía Láctea de verano muestra estructura fina, y las nubes parecen hoyos negros entre las estrellas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The summit sits above most low cloud, so the score counts mid and high cloud only.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The summit sits above most low cloud, so the score counts mid and high cloud only."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La cumbre queda por encima de casi toda la nube baja, así que el índice solo cuenta las nubes medias y altas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The time river, each calendar month and the shape of the night offer an audio graph: choose Audio Graph in the rotor to hear the nights rise and fall as a tone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The time river, each calendar month and the shape of the night offer an audio graph: choose Audio Graph in the rotor to hear the nights rise and fall as a tone."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El río del tiempo, cada mes del calendario y la forma de la noche ofrecen una gráfica de audio: elige Gráfica de audio en el rotor para oír cómo suben y bajan las noches en un tono."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The tone falls as the sky darkens and rises toward dawn. It softens while the Moon is up, more for a fuller Moon. A rising pulse is moonrise, a falling pulse moonset, and a chime the Milky Way's core rising.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The tone falls as the sky darkens and rises toward dawn. It softens while the Moon is up, more for a fuller Moon. A rising pulse is moonrise, a falling pulse moonset, and a chime the Milky Way's core rising."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El tono baja a medida que el cielo se oscurece y sube hacia el amanecer. Se suaviza mientras la Luna está en el cielo, más cuanto más llena está. Un pulso ascendente es la salida de la Luna; uno descendente, la puesta de la Luna, y una campanada, la salida del núcleo de la Vía Láctea."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The tone points to %@.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The tone points to %@."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El tono apunta a %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The towns and cities you can start from come from the U.S. Census Bureau's 2025 Gazetteer Files (Places) and its Vintage 2025 population estimates, which are in the public domain. Each place is a single interior point, not a city center, and only straight-line distances are measured from it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The towns and cities you can start from come from the U.S. Census Bureau's 2025 Gazetteer Files (Places) and its Vintage 2025 population estimates, which are in the public domain. Each place is a single interior point, not a city center, and only straight-line distances are measured from it."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Los pueblos y ciudades desde los que puedes partir vienen de los Gazetteer Files 2025 (Places) y de las estimaciones de población Vintage 2025 de la Oficina del Censo de EE. UU., que son de dominio público. Cada lugar es un solo punto interior, no el centro de la ciudad, y desde él solo se miden distancias en línea recta."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There is not enough free space to open your journal. Free up some space, then open Nyx again. Everything else works, and Nyx left your journal untouched.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "There is not enough free space to open your journal. Free up some space, then open Nyx again. Everything else works, and Nyx left your journal untouched."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No hay suficiente espacio libre para abrir tu diario. Libera espacio y vuelve a abrir Nyx. Todo lo demás funciona, y Nyx no tocó tu diario."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These nights have passed. Look ahead to the next new moon.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These nights have passed. Look ahead to the next new moon."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estas noches ya pasaron. Mira hacia la próxima luna nueva."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thin high cloud; bright stars only.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Thin high cloud; bright stars only."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nubes altas y finas; solo estrellas brillantes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
