    "When Nyx crashes or stops responding, iOS may give it a technical report about a day later. Nyx keeps the last five here, on this device. Nothing is sent anywhere unless you copy or share it yourself.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When Nyx crashes or stops responding, iOS may give it a technical report about a day later. Nyx keeps the last five here, on this device. Nothing is sent anywhere unless you copy or share it yourself."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cuando Nyx se cierra inesperadamente o deja de responder, iOS puede darle un informe técnico aproximadamente un día después. Nyx guarda los últimos cinco aquí, en este dispositivo. No se envía nada a ningún lado, a menos que tú lo copies o compartas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
